#THIS IS FILE IMPRUN, imp_run(): THE MAIN PROGRAM OF THE IMP72 SOURCE (THE STATEMENTS BEFORE ITS FIRST SUBR, THE FUNCTION impmain), RUN WHERE A C PROGRAM WITH A main OF ITS OWN WANTS IT, AFTER imp_init.  IT IS A MEMBER OF ITS OWN BECAUSE IT NEEDS impmain, WHICH A SOURCE WITH NO MAIN PROGRAM DOES NOT HAVE: A C PROGRAM THAT ONLY CALLS imp_init AND THE IMP ROUTINES DOES NOT LINK IT #
SUBR imp_run(Z) IS impmain(0)
%%
